    ],
    "text": "STATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT",
    "fonts": [
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.47,
      256.99,
      455.49,
      275.66
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2 : This clause amends section 345 of the Penal Code (Chapter 19) and the legaleffect of the amendment is to\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      159.91,
      285.79,
      455.52,
      304.46
    ],
    "text": "(a)extend the application of that section to a sexual harassment caused by means ofany communication;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      159.91,
      314.59,
      455.52,
      333.26
    ],
    "text": "(b)define the series of activities by which the sexual harassment may cause byusing words or actions; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      160.75,
      343.39,
      322.89,
      352.46
    ],
    "text": "(c)define the expression \u201ccommunication\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      230.13,
      166.97,
      401.69,
      178.31
    ],
    "text": "Penal Code (Amendment)1",
