  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      190.29,
      228.53,
      373.41,
      239.87
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE PENAL CODE ( CHAPTER 19 )",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      253.73,
      401.86,
      277.67
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows: -",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      291.53,
      401.88,
      315.47
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Penal Code (Amendment)Act, No of 2024.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      329.33,
      401.87,
      353.27
    ],
    "text": "2. Section 345 of the Penal Code (Chapter 19) is herebyrepealed and the following section is substituted therefor:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      367.13,
      401.89,
      529.67
    ],
    "text": "345. (1) Whoever, by assault or use ofcriminal force, or by the use of words or actionsor by means of any communication, causessexual annoyance or harassment to anotherperson commits the offence of sexualharassment and shall on conviction bepunished with imprisonment of eitherdescription for a term which may extend tofive years or with fine or with both and mayalso be ordered to pay compensation of anamount determined by court to the person inrespect of whom the offence was committedfor the injuries caused to such person.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      543.53,
      401.87,
      580.07
    ],
    "text": "(2) The \u201cuse of words or actions\u201d referredto in subsection (1) which amount to sexualharassment includes \u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      249.57,
      593.93,
      392.26,
      605.27
    ],
    "text": "(a)making any sound or gesture;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      249.57,
      619.13,
      362.27,
      630.47
    ],
    "text": "(b)exhibiting any object;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      250.29,
      644.33,
      401.87,
      668.63
    ],
    "text": "(c)disrobing or compelling suchperson to be naked;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      143.85,
      403.97,
      154.29,
      415.31
    ],
    "text": "10",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      144.81,
      543.89,
      155.25,
      555.23
    ],
    "text": "20",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
