  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      245.95,
      203.69,
      398.24,
      240.35
    ],
    "text": "(d)physical contact and advancesinvolving unwelcome andexplicit sexual overtures;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      246.67,
      254.21,
      398.23,
      278.15
    ],
    "text": "(e)demanding or requesting forsexual favours;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      248.11,
      292.01,
      398.23,
      315.95
    ],
    "text": "(f)showing pornography againstthe will of such person;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      245.95,
      329.81,
      398.24,
      353.75
    ],
    "text": "(g)making sexually colouredremarks; or",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      245.95,
      367.61,
      398.24,
      404.15
    ],
    "text": "(h)exposing genitals with theintention of causing alarm ordistress.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      212.11,
      418.01,
      398.16,
      504.95
    ],
    "text": "(3) The \u201ccommunication\u201d referred to insubsection (1) which amount to sexualharassment includes transmitting, distributing,sharing, generating, propagating or publishingany sexually explicit message, remark, image,audio or video through electronic means orinternet.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      212.11,
      518.81,
      398.27,
      567.95
    ],
    "text": "(4) For the purposes of this section, anassault may include any act that does notamount to rape under section 363 or gravesexual abuse under section 365B.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      230.11,
      581.81,
      398.13,
      618.35
    ],
    "text": "Explanation \u2013 \u201cinjuries\u201d includespsychological or mentaltrauma.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      158.11,
      632.21,
      398.27,
      656.27
    ],
    "text": "3. In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
